flowchart TB
    subgraph publication[Publication · ENV is local or yandex]
        direction LR
        upload["//infra/download:publish.ENV<br/>Upload artifacts only<br/>rsync via SSH, sudo as download"]
        files[(projects/PROJECT/releases/VERSION<br/>Complete release becomes public atomically)]
        extract["//infra/download:website.extract.ENV<br/>--site_archive NAME · validate/extract locally<br/>Stage and promote completed site"]
        link["//infra/download:website.activate.ENV<br/>Atomically select sites/PROJECT/current<br/>Retain earlier sites and archives for rollback"]
        upload --> files --> extract --> link
    end
    subgraph automatic[Automatic · each VM]
        direction LR
        timer[Daily timer + missed-run catch-up<br/>download-deduplicate.timer]
        dedup[duperemove · projects/ + third_party/ + sites/<br/>Private incremental hash database<br/>50% CPU · 512 MiB · 6h deadline]
        extents[Share identical Btrfs extents<br/>Preserve bytes and current selection<br/>No release deletion]
        timer --> dedup --> extents
        proxy[Traefik ACME renewal<br/>Private state on system disk]
        issuer[Let's Encrypt for Yandex<br/>Vault + EAB for XCP-ng<br/>Issuer DNS + port 80 must reach the VM]
        proxy --> issuer
    end
    subgraph operator[Operator checks and recovery]
        direction LR
        health[ssh.local OR ssh.yandex<br/>Check services, timer, mount, free space<br/>Check DNS views, TLS, URLs, redirects]
        recover[Site issue: select a retained version<br/>Use its bundle with website.activate.ENV<br/>Config issue: reviewed IaC redeployment<br/>Capacity: explicitly delete an inactive release]
        boundary[No backups, replication, or failover<br/>Lost content needs an external retained copy<br/>XCP-ng replacement needs a new storage workflow]
        health --> recover --> boundary
    end
    publication ~~~ automatic ~~~ operator
